{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415020","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041502001:1":{"text":"...위에서 언급했던 것처럼 식사는 꼭 필요한 것도 아니며, 시간까지 낭비하는 비생산적인 활동이야.","source_cn":"……如上所述，进食既非必要，又是浪费时间的举动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC34FE09C5456C16B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041502002:1":{"text":"차라리 그 시간을 본업에 쏟는 게 나아.","source_cn":"不如把这些精力放在正职上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x886CB4DD971DBB66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041502003:1":{"text":"스칼리타, 우리는 행복해야 해. 언제, 어디서, 무슨 일이 벌어져도 말이지.","source_cn":"我们都应该快乐点，斯克嘉莉德，无论在哪，无论什么时候，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E5B6B4D55608DB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041502004:1":{"text":"여신의 빛을 널리 알리는 자들인데, 사람들에게 우리의 우아한 모습을 보여줘야 하지 않겠어? 환영 파티에서 행복한 시간을 보내면 마음속 깊은 곳에서 희망이 샘솟을 텐데...","source_cn":"要散播女神的光辉，难道不该让世人见到我们的优雅从容吗？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94907365FB8DF874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041502005:1":{"text":"난 반대야. 무의미한 쾌락주의는 결국 무의미한 낭비를 불러올 거야.","source_cn":"反对。无意义的享乐主义只会招致更多无意义的浪费。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x711500D6A6911B2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041502006:1":{"text":"그렇다면 좋은 윤활유로 너의 강철 관절을 정비한다고 생각해 봐. 이건 뭔데?","source_cn":"那么，请假想这样的情况：用上好的润滑油为你的钢铁关节进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39DE91C46A58843B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041502007:1":{"text":"그건 작전을 위해 꼭 준비해야 하는 거고.","source_cn":"那是必要的作战准备。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81BB2919D6379D3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:斯克嘉莉德":{"text":"스칼리타","source":"斯克嘉莉德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"샤키탈리스","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}